<title>USA: TENNIS-OAKLAND WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-OAKLAND WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>OAKLAND, California 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$450,000 Bank of the West Classic women's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Thursday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>3-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat Linda Wild (U.S.) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) beat 3-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.)</p>
<p>6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Irina Spirlea (Romania) beat Paola Suarez (Argentina) 6-2 6-1</p>
</text>
